        <mxCell id="rules" parent="1" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=20;fontSize=20;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;spacing=15;" value="BUSINESS RULES&#xa;Access: teacher edits assigned lessons; homeroom access alone is read-only. STAFF edits school-wide. ADMIN requires an Employee profile.&#xa;Time: no marking before lesson start. Teacher locks at 00:00 next day (Vietnam time). STAFF / ADMIN are exempt from that deadline.&#xa;Results: PRESENT / ABSENT / LATE / EXCUSED. EXCUSED requires approved leave for the same student and date.&#xa;Corrections require a reason. Stale roster / versions require reload. Unchanged saves create no new audit or notification.&#xa;Notifications: absence / lateness alerts and their corrections; comments alone do not create another alert. Missing active parent: save succeeds with a warning.&#xa;Success response does not wait for notification delivery. Completed attendance is derived; there is no stored Submitted session status." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="260" width="2740" x="20" y="1370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
